{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Preparing the Proposal", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Peter Rubs It In", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 10, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Exchange advice and suggestions in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Discusses a range of options for potential actions at work through the correct use of grammar, vocabulary; level of formality and purpose, and cohesion and coherence aspects appropriate to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Making and Responding to Suggestions ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Sometimes you have an idea, a recommendation or plan that you think could work for your company. It is important to use proper language to offer those ideas for someone to consider. Here is some language you can use for making and responding to recommendations. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Making Suggestions/Recommendations\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to Suggestions/ Recommendations \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You could ... (+verb) <br/> You might want to ... (+verb)<br/>   Why not ... (+verb)<br/>   Why don't you ... (+verb)<br/>     How about ... (-ing) <br/>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"That's not a bad idea. <br/> Exactly.<br/> I like the sound of that. <br/> Oh, well ... <br/> Oh no. \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Hey, do you know of a nice restaurant around here?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Well, <span class=\"underline\">how about</span> go<span class=\"underline\">ing</span> to Joint Tea?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"underline\">That's a good idea</span>, thanks!", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Interrupting, Changing and Getting Back to a Topic", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "In English, sometimes we need to interrupt people. This can be because we need to say something, express our opinion, or make a suggestion. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "In a conversation, interruptions are acceptable and perfectly normal if done appropriately. You will also need to interrupt and change topics. Once the other person has stopped speaking, you will need to return to the topic you were previously talking about. Here are some common ways you can do them: ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Interrupting\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Changing the topic\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Returning to the topic\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Sorry but ... (+ clause)</li><li>Er, well ... (+clause)</li><li>Excuse me, but ... (+clause)</li><li>Can I just say something?</li><li>Well, ... (+clause) </li><li>I don't mean to intrude but ...</li><li> Can I just jump in here for a minute?</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Speaking of ... </li><li>By the way, ... </li><li>Talking of ... </li><li>That reminds me ... </li><li>Speaking of which ... </li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>As I was saying ... </li><li>Anyway, ... </li><li>Going back to what I was saying ... </li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I want to take my mother to a nice restaurant. I was thinking ... ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Sorry, but</span> why don't you just cook her a meal?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Not sure it's a good idea. <span class=\"strong\">Anyway, as I was saying</span>, I want to take her out.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "glassblowing", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the process of making glass by blowing air through a tube ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Lately, she's been into glassblowing.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob10aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about social activities. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "coffee roasting", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the process of cooking coffee beans", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Is there still a coffee roasting workshop here?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob10aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "jewelry making", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the process of assembling and forming jewelry by hand ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Why not take her to a jewelry making session?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob10aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to browse through", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to scan through something to get an idea of what it includes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She likes browsing through second-hand bookstores.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob10aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "candle making", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the process of creating a candle using wax", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I prefer candle making over jewelry making.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob10aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "soap making", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the process of producing a bar of soap", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My mom enjoys soap making in her spare time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob10aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob10re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write a list of your social activities (about 3 to 5) you like to do in your area, neighborhood or workplace.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write one or two things you like about each activity.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Have a conversation with your partner and suggest an activity to do after school or work. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Interrupt your partner and suggest another activity. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make sure you interrupt, change the topic, and suggest a few different activities. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you are finished, switch roles.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I have a conversation about my favorite activities.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I politely interrupt during a conversation. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make and respond to suggestions. ", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can make and respond to suggestions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can interrupt someone, change and get back to a topic.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about social activities.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What is your favorite place in your local area?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Why do you like it?", "type": "Free Header Item