ng important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn7le04ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Mmm, smells like roasted espresso in here. Oh, does anyone know if there's still a coffee roasting workshop here? I was thinking of taking my mom and ... <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Er, well, I don't know her. But if ... <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: But you've heard us on the phone before.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Anyway ... as I was saying, you did mention she likes jewelry. Why not take her to a jewelry making workshop?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's not a bad idea. But I am really considering the coffee roasting workshop. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Ok. Maybe if we get a general sense of her preferences we could help. Why don't you tell us about her?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn7le04ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: She's just lovely. She likes browsing through second-hand bookstores, candle making, soap making. Lately, she's been into glassblowing. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Sorry to interrupt, but what is that?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It's a technique that involves inflating molten glass into a bubble with the aid of a blowpipe.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: I don't mean to intrude, but ... Can I just jump in here for a minute? Peter, that sounds boring. How about taking her for dinner?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh no. She eats like a bird. Money and food would be wasted.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I have it. I heard there's a workshop on jewelry making. You could take her there.", "id": 2, "time": "33900", "image": "engenn7le04ob10re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's perfect. She loves jewelry. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I suggest you register in advance. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Sorry, but why don't you just cook her dinner then?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: She's never liked my cooking. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Going back to what I was saying, these workshops get booked up pretty quickly.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'll keep that in mind. Thanks for the suggestions guys. See ya!", "id": 3, "time": "69400", "image": "engenn7le04ob10re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le04ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le04ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}